WEBVTT

00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:37.250
Well then...

00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:41.292
...we now begin the vow exchange ceremony.

00:00:42.708 --> 00:00:47.250
Kirin Shima. Do you take
this woman to be your Amica

00:00:47.250 --> 00:00:51.417
and vow to love her as
long as you both shall live?

00:00:51.417 --> 00:00:53.167
I do.

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:59.042
Raika Hino. Do you take
this woman to be your Amica

00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:02.708
and vow to love her as
long as you both shall live?

00:01:02.708 --> 00:01:04.542
I do.

00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:07.208
You two may now kiss.

00:01:09.917 --> 00:01:13.125
Smoooo...

00:01:13.125 --> 00:01:15.708
...ooooooooch.

00:01:15.708 --> 00:01:17.625
Hold on a minute!

00:01:28.750 --> 00:01:30.125
Who's there?!

00:01:31.458 --> 00:01:33.375
I'll take Rin-Rin with me!

00:01:33.375 --> 00:01:35.417
An Amica stealer?!

00:01:35.417 --> 00:01:36.750
Step back!

00:01:47.625 --> 00:01:48.917
Incredible!

00:01:48.917 --> 00:01:51.208
She isn't called "Aria the Quadra" for nothing!

00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:07.292
Raika!

00:02:07.292 --> 00:02:08.208
Shoot!

00:02:08.208 --> 00:02:08.792
Kirin!

00:02:08.792 --> 00:02:12.958
Oh, no!

00:02:12.958 --> 00:02:17.625
Now, dump that mannish woman
and let's be happy together!

00:02:17.625 --> 00:02:20.042
Okay, Riko!

00:02:26.792 --> 00:02:30.875
Kirin!

00:02:38.958 --> 00:02:41.083
This is terrible.

00:02:41.625 --> 00:02:43.917
"To my dear Raika
In celebration of our Amica contract"

00:04:23.417 --> 00:04:27.125
Well then, let's toast to
Team Mamiya's victory in Quartet

00:04:27.125 --> 00:04:30.667
and to Akari Mamiya's promotion to D Rank!

00:04:30.667 --> 00:04:31.917
Cheers!

00:04:31.917 --> 00:04:34.542
Thank you very much!

00:04:34.542 --> 00:04:37.000
You're finally out of E Rank.

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:38.792
Thanks!

00:04:38.792 --> 00:04:42.458
But I feel bad that I was the
only one who got a promotion in rank.

00:04:42.458 --> 00:04:46.458
Oh, don't. You're the one who
led our team to the victory at the end.

00:04:46.458 --> 00:04:50.792
She's right. It's all thanks to you that we won.

00:04:50.792 --> 00:04:52.333
I heard that for your promotion,

00:04:52.333 --> 00:04:56.958
they took into account that you
helped Urara Takachiho at the end.

00:04:56.958 --> 00:05:00.125
You really did a good job, Akari.

00:05:00.125 --> 00:05:02.625
Aria...

00:05:02.625 --> 00:05:07.792
But that was scary, wasn't it, Sis?
To think that the scaffolding collapsed...

00:05:07.792 --> 00:05:12.417
Yeah. They should do a better job
managing the construction site.

00:05:12.417 --> 00:05:17.500
You don't suppose someone
actually set it up to collapse, do you?

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.292
About that...

00:05:24.833 --> 00:05:26.833
My on-site investigation...

00:05:28.208 --> 00:05:32.292
...didn't reveal anything suspicious.

00:05:32.292 --> 00:05:34.708
Then, it was an accident after all.

00:05:34.708 --> 00:05:36.750
No one would go through so much trouble

00:05:36.750 --> 00:05:39.917
just to hinder a high
school test, now would they?

00:05:48.917 --> 00:05:51.750
Reki, it's thanks to you that
my sister wasn't hurt, right?

00:05:51.750 --> 00:05:56.167
She said that your sniping was like a miracle.

00:05:56.167 --> 00:05:58.458
Thank you very much for saving me!

00:05:59.667 --> 00:06:01.500
You're welcome.

00:06:01.500 --> 00:06:05.833
To tell you the truth,
I had a bad feeling somehow.

00:06:05.833 --> 00:06:08.833
So I asked Reki to come just in case. Right?

00:06:08.833 --> 00:06:09.708
Yes.

00:06:09.708 --> 00:06:11.667
I'd expect nothing less from you, Aria!

00:06:11.667 --> 00:06:15.375
But it seems that I was
worried over nothing after all.

00:06:15.375 --> 00:06:21.000
We should always be careful, though,
as being a <i>butei </i>can cause bad guys...

00:06:21.000 --> 00:06:23.708
...to hold a grudge against us.

00:06:23.708 --> 00:06:28.583
I'll be fine, since I've got my upperclassmen!

00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:30.667
Oh, that's a cute thing to say!

00:06:30.667 --> 00:06:32.542
Just for that, I'll do this...

00:06:32.542 --> 00:06:34.208
...to you!

00:06:34.208 --> 00:06:37.458
And... this and this!

00:06:37.458 --> 00:06:38.583
Tickle, tickle, tickle!

00:06:38.583 --> 00:06:40.625
Please stop!

00:06:42.042 --> 00:06:43.208
But Akari...

00:06:43.208 --> 00:06:45.000
Y-Yes?

00:06:45.000 --> 00:06:50.083
...if the battle with Urara Takachiho
had been real, you would've been dead.

00:06:50.083 --> 00:06:52.875
There's no battle in which it's okay to die.

00:06:52.875 --> 00:06:55.292
Right.

00:06:55.292 --> 00:06:58.750
But still... you did win.

00:06:58.750 --> 00:07:00.375
Congratulations.

00:07:01.917 --> 00:07:03.833
Aria!

00:07:06.542 --> 00:07:09.042
It wasn't a bad move, though.

00:07:12.250 --> 00:07:14.083
Sis...

00:07:21.208 --> 00:07:24.500
You're wasting your time.
Now, don't run amok in the restaurant.

00:07:29.417 --> 00:07:32.167
Ow, ow, ow...

00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:36.250
That was very close.

00:07:37.792 --> 00:07:39.292
Ahem!

00:07:41.167 --> 00:07:43.083
Takachiho...

00:07:43.083 --> 00:07:44.667
Did you come for payback?

00:07:44.667 --> 00:07:48.417
Well, well... A poor girl's got
a poor imagination, too, huh?

00:07:48.417 --> 00:07:49.792
What'd you say?!

00:07:49.792 --> 00:07:53.458
People from Tottori are courteous
and have a strong sense of obligation.

00:07:55.958 --> 00:07:56.750
"Ya"

00:07:56.750 --> 00:07:59.750
This is to thank you for saving
me and to congratulate your victory.

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:03.125
Whoa! Thank you, Takachiho!

00:08:05.250 --> 00:08:08.125
Yuyu. Yaya. Let's go back.

00:08:08.125 --> 00:08:10.167
Humph!

00:08:10.167 --> 00:08:12.833
She's as annoying as ever.

00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:15.417
Make sure she didn't do anything
to the bouquet to cause you trouble.

00:08:15.417 --> 00:08:18.333
Oh, come on. It's fine.

00:08:18.333 --> 00:08:22.292
You're softhearted.
You should take it apart and check it.

00:08:22.292 --> 00:08:25.333
No! She took the trouble to bring this gift.

00:08:25.333 --> 00:08:27.000
Just show it to me!

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:28.833
No! I won't let you do that!

00:08:31.000 --> 00:08:32.708
Let's pick up where we left off, too!

00:08:32.708 --> 00:08:36.792
Here, Rin-Rin! Let me show you my affection!

00:08:36.792 --> 00:08:38.833
--Please stop!
--Tickle, tickle.

00:08:44.167 --> 00:08:45.958
Why don't we hang out a bit longer?

00:08:45.958 --> 00:08:49.625
Yeah. I don't feel like we celebrated enough.

00:08:49.625 --> 00:08:51.958
To think that my assistance
helped them to be this happy...

00:08:51.958 --> 00:08:53.917
I must be a person of virtue.

00:08:55.167 --> 00:08:57.833
Well, I have to get going.

00:08:57.833 --> 00:09:00.083
What? Already?!

00:09:00.083 --> 00:09:04.958
I'm pretty busy, you know.
You guys stay a bit longer and have fun.

00:09:04.958 --> 00:09:07.000
Oh, that's right, Aria!

00:09:07.000 --> 00:09:08.000
Hm?

00:09:08.000 --> 00:09:13.750
I was promoted to D Rank because
of this good-luck charm you gave me.

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:15.708
Thank you very much!

00:09:15.708 --> 00:09:17.583
Hey, that's...

00:09:17.583 --> 00:09:19.417
...a Safe Childbirth Charm.

00:09:19.417 --> 00:09:20.792
Er...

00:09:23.583 --> 00:09:25.875
Wh-What?

00:09:25.875 --> 00:09:28.708
Aria gave it to me. Don't criticize...

00:09:28.708 --> 00:09:30.708
...the charm she gave me!

00:09:30.708 --> 00:09:33.000
I didn't!

00:09:33.000 --> 00:09:34.583
Hey, stop it!

00:09:34.583 --> 00:09:36.042
Go away already!

00:09:36.042 --> 00:09:39.167
Okay, okay!

00:09:39.167 --> 00:09:42.250
But... I'm a bit surprised...

00:09:42.250 --> 00:09:43.375
Huh?

00:09:43.375 --> 00:09:46.542
...to see that Aria has a friend like you,

00:09:46.542 --> 00:09:50.917
since she said before
that she didn't need friends.

00:09:53.042 --> 00:09:56.417
Akari! Just come back.

00:09:56.417 --> 00:10:01.500
Anyway, it means that I'm free
while she's doing stuff with you.

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.583
See ya.

00:10:03.542 --> 00:10:06.500
Is something wrong, Akari?

00:10:06.500 --> 00:10:08.500
Come back already!

00:10:10.000 --> 00:10:12.917
Kii showed up at the wrong time, huh?

00:10:12.917 --> 00:10:16.750
Kii? Do you mean Kinji Tohyama?

00:10:16.750 --> 00:10:18.792
Yep. We're close.

00:10:18.792 --> 00:10:20.875
Oh, but don't worry.

00:10:20.875 --> 00:10:24.750
I'll be closer to you, Kirin!

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:26.333
Rin-Rin!

00:10:33.792 --> 00:10:36.542
Am I worrying too much about stupid stuff?

00:10:37.958 --> 00:10:39.500
Rin-Rin!

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.042
Arrrrrrrrgh!

00:10:50.792 --> 00:10:55.542
I-I'm reading too much
into it, right? Right, Jonathan?

00:10:57.167 --> 00:11:02.458
But Raika and Miss Mamiya seem
to have been close for a long time.

00:11:02.458 --> 00:11:04.792
Arrrrrrrgh!

00:11:08.333 --> 00:11:11.625
I see... Then, you didn't see it?

00:11:11.625 --> 00:11:16.667
No. I was fighting Raika Hino at the time, so...

00:11:16.667 --> 00:11:22.375
I couldn't see it clearly,
but she used another strange technique.

00:11:25.333 --> 00:11:27.792
It was like a supernatural power.

00:11:30.375 --> 00:11:32.833
An accident happened.

00:11:32.833 --> 00:11:39.625
And Akari was driven into a situation
where she had to use that technique.

00:11:39.625 --> 00:11:42.708
Isn't that too convenient?

00:11:45.375 --> 00:11:48.125
I'm not sure what it is,
but something is still bothering me.

00:11:48.125 --> 00:11:49.792
What do you think?

00:11:49.792 --> 00:11:52.750
It might be beyond my capacity.

00:11:52.750 --> 00:11:55.958
You may want to ask her directly.

00:11:55.958 --> 00:11:57.542
Hmm...

00:11:57.542 --> 00:12:01.500
It might be better to leave it
as-is until she tells me.

00:12:01.500 --> 00:12:03.542
It's tricky, isn't it?

00:12:06.625 --> 00:12:07.542
"Kyochikutou"
"Line in use" "End call"

00:12:07.542 --> 00:12:08.625
Yep.

00:12:08.625 --> 00:12:12.375
I think I'm gonna keep
a low profile for a while.

00:12:12.375 --> 00:12:15.625
Aria was investigating
the site the other day, too.

00:12:15.625 --> 00:12:17.875
She's got good instincts, at least, so...

00:12:17.875 --> 00:12:21.208
Either way, she is no threat to me, though.

00:12:21.208 --> 00:12:24.583
Besides, doesn't it sound fun
to come up with plans separately

00:12:24.583 --> 00:12:26.750
and compare them later?

00:12:29.667 --> 00:12:30.667
"Lessons from Aria: 1. Crimes and
incidents don't wait for <i>butei </i>to be ready.

00:12:30.667 --> 00:12:31.667
2. Don't say 'I can't.' | 3. Be punctual
4. Always pay close attention to the surroundings."

00:12:31.667 --> 00:12:32.667
"5. There's no battle in which it's okay to die."

00:12:33.042 --> 00:12:36.917
She said before that she didn't need friends.

00:12:43.125 --> 00:12:45.500
Sis, I'm done with my bath.

00:12:45.500 --> 00:12:48.417
Ah, okay. Thanks.

00:12:51.250 --> 00:12:53.583
What's wrong, Nonoka?!

00:12:53.583 --> 00:12:57.250
Nothing. The bath might've made me a bit dizzy.

00:13:00.167 --> 00:13:02.583
You don't have to wait
for me to go to bed, okay?

00:13:06.167 --> 00:13:09.875
I wonder what's going on...
Lately, I kinda feel like...

00:13:12.208 --> 00:13:13.458
"1-A | Mamiya"
"Akari's Album 1, Photo Stickers"

00:13:16.625 --> 00:13:17.958
"Chick"

00:13:18.542 --> 00:13:21.625
I can't smell Akari...

00:13:21.625 --> 00:13:23.792
I'm so sorry, Miss Shino!

00:13:23.792 --> 00:13:27.708
We had Miss Akari's pillow cleaned by mistake!

00:13:27.708 --> 00:13:32.958
I'm sorry! I'm sorry! I'm sorry...!

00:13:41.125 --> 00:13:42.792
Aim a bit lower.

00:13:42.792 --> 00:13:44.958
Even if you miss, you can still
see the smoke from where they hit.

00:13:44.958 --> 00:13:46.292
Okay!

00:13:49.375 --> 00:13:51.000
Right. Good job.

00:13:52.208 --> 00:13:56.500
--Staring...
--Thanks, Raika, for helping me practice.

00:13:56.500 --> 00:14:01.667
No problem, but voluntary training early
in the morning? You're pretty eager.

00:14:01.667 --> 00:14:04.958
The battle with Takachiho made me realize

00:14:04.958 --> 00:14:08.167
that I need to practice shooting more often.

00:14:08.167 --> 00:14:12.125
And I'll become Aria's official Amica!

00:14:12.125 --> 00:14:16.208
Well, if I can be of assistance,
I'll help you as much as you like.

00:14:16.208 --> 00:14:19.625
Class will start soon. Shall we get going?

00:14:21.542 --> 00:14:23.167
Put the gun away!

00:14:25.458 --> 00:14:27.750
You... stupid Raika!

00:14:27.750 --> 00:14:30.792
You panty hunter!

00:14:31.667 --> 00:14:35.708
They really are too close.

00:14:37.000 --> 00:14:41.458
That's why I'm making an emergency call to you.

00:14:41.458 --> 00:14:45.000
Don't worry about it.
I'm not doing anything right now.

00:14:45.000 --> 00:14:49.833
In short, you're worried because
Aka-rin and Rai-kan are close, right?

00:14:49.833 --> 00:14:51.542
That's right!

00:14:51.542 --> 00:14:53.667
If something happens between them,

00:14:53.667 --> 00:14:57.583
the friendship among the four
of us will become complicated!

00:14:57.583 --> 00:14:59.667
Well, Rai-kan may be taking the fact

00:14:59.667 --> 00:15:02.917
that her Amica belongs
to CVR's Division 2 lightly.

00:15:02.917 --> 00:15:06.000
Then, how about going for the Manifesto?

00:15:06.000 --> 00:15:08.417
Ahh! That's it!

00:15:09.458 --> 00:15:10.042
"Voluntary Course Substitute Instructor Request"

00:15:10.042 --> 00:15:13.042
"Voluntary Course Substitute Instructor Request"
Giving derringer training in CVR?

00:15:13.042 --> 00:15:14.917
Having me as a substitute instructor?

00:15:14.917 --> 00:15:17.958
Yes! Division 2 beta workforce class.

00:15:17.958 --> 00:15:22.583
I've got some small, cute classmates.
Please give us lessons.

00:15:22.583 --> 00:15:24.625
Flash.

00:15:24.625 --> 00:15:28.833
Please teach us, Raika!

00:15:28.833 --> 00:15:34.083
N-No! It's pointless to teach
those who can't even shoot properly.

00:15:35.083 --> 00:15:41.292
Oh? Is it possible that you
aren't good with small guns?

00:15:41.292 --> 00:15:45.875
You must be afraid of making mistakes
in front of us! What a chicken!

00:15:45.875 --> 00:15:49.042
There's no way that's the case! Then, I'll--

00:15:49.042 --> 00:15:52.583
A-Anyway, I said no! I refuse!

00:15:52.583 --> 00:15:53.958
Huh?

00:15:57.833 --> 00:16:02.000
I think you should stop being
mean and grant Kirin's request.

00:16:02.000 --> 00:16:04.458
I'm not trying to be mean or anything.

00:16:04.458 --> 00:16:07.542
But... How should I put it... It's just that...

00:16:07.542 --> 00:16:12.917
...I don't like the feeling that
I'll just do anything she asks.

00:16:12.917 --> 00:16:14.500
Huh?

00:16:14.500 --> 00:16:15.625
Come to think of it,

00:16:15.625 --> 00:16:19.042
you said you were displaying her
picture in your room at her request.

00:16:19.042 --> 00:16:20.083
Teehee!

00:16:21.208 --> 00:16:22.792
D-Don't talk about it!

00:16:22.792 --> 00:16:25.208
In short, you're not honest
with yourself about your feelings.

00:16:25.208 --> 00:16:26.958
Shut up!

00:16:26.958 --> 00:16:29.667
Why is she coming to me
for that in the first place?!

00:16:29.667 --> 00:16:31.292
Teaching just Kirin is one thing,

00:16:31.292 --> 00:16:34.208
but I can't take care of
junior high brats I don't even know!

00:16:34.208 --> 00:16:36.625
Hmm... I wonder what's going on...

00:16:36.625 --> 00:16:38.917
I wonder if she has some reason for this...

00:16:38.917 --> 00:16:39.458
Huh?

00:16:39.458 --> 00:16:41.167
What reason?

00:16:41.167 --> 00:16:43.958
I don't know, but I somehow
feel that way intuitively.

00:16:43.958 --> 00:16:46.958
Hey, why don't you grant her request?

00:16:46.958 --> 00:16:49.000
I bet she'll be happy.

00:16:49.000 --> 00:16:52.125
No! I don't wanna do it!

00:16:52.125 --> 00:16:57.833
What?! You're going to do it?!
I'm so happy, Raika!

00:16:57.833 --> 00:17:00.708
I'm reluctant, but since
Akari insists I should...

00:17:00.708 --> 00:17:02.167
Miss Mamiya?!

00:17:02.167 --> 00:17:03.917
Stop saying that.

00:17:03.917 --> 00:17:05.417
But it's the truth.

00:17:05.417 --> 00:17:09.458
Well then, I have to go see Aria. Good luck!

00:17:09.458 --> 00:17:12.375
Thanks! You work hard, too!

00:17:12.375 --> 00:17:16.792
You don't grant my request when <i>I </i>ask...

00:17:16.792 --> 00:17:20.625
...but you'd do it for Miss Mamiya?

00:17:20.625 --> 00:17:21.542
Huh?

00:17:21.542 --> 00:17:24.625
Never mind. Let's go, then!

00:17:28.167 --> 00:17:29.333
I'm Rui!

00:17:29.333 --> 00:17:30.708
I'm Kuu!

00:17:30.708 --> 00:17:31.875
I'm Moyu!

00:17:31.875 --> 00:17:33.417
I'm Kira!

00:17:34.958 --> 00:17:36.333
Nice to meet you.

00:17:38.417 --> 00:17:42.417
Look! When you use a derringer,
rather than aim and shoot,

00:17:42.417 --> 00:17:44.000
you press and shoot.

00:17:45.542 --> 00:17:46.417
Wonderful!

00:17:46.417 --> 00:17:47.458
You're so cool!

00:17:47.458 --> 00:17:48.833
You're like a prince!

00:17:48.833 --> 00:17:50.292
I'm so falling for you!

00:17:50.292 --> 00:17:54.000
Pay more attention! I'll do it one more time.

00:17:54.000 --> 00:17:55.708
Press and shoot.

00:17:57.083 --> 00:18:00.125
Seriously... I said, pay more attention!

00:18:09.000 --> 00:18:11.875
Thank you very much!

00:18:11.875 --> 00:18:15.750
Thank you so much for
giving us lessons today, Raika.

00:18:15.750 --> 00:18:19.750
No problem, but you should
master things like that in the class.

00:18:19.750 --> 00:18:21.583
I have something for you
to show my appreciation.

00:18:21.583 --> 00:18:25.042
What? I thought the compensation
was coming from the school.

00:18:25.042 --> 00:18:26.083
Come with me!

00:18:26.083 --> 00:18:27.000
H-Hey!

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:30.917
This way, please. This way, please...

00:18:30.917 --> 00:18:32.708
Oops.

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:42.292
What is this place?

00:18:42.292 --> 00:18:45.083
Hey, Kirin! Huh?

00:18:45.625 --> 00:18:47.375
Welcome...

00:18:47.375 --> 00:18:50.292
...to the CVR training room!

00:18:50.292 --> 00:18:51.750
Raika!

00:18:51.750 --> 00:18:53.792
Wh-What're you guys doing?!

00:18:53.792 --> 00:18:56.125
Raika!

00:18:57.208 --> 00:18:59.125
Wh-What're you guys doing?

00:18:59.125 --> 00:19:01.958
--Raika!
--What do you think you're doing?

00:19:01.958 --> 00:19:05.000
You like it, Raika?

00:19:05.000 --> 00:19:07.583
When we see you,

00:19:07.583 --> 00:19:11.875
we're able to immediately turn ourselves into...

00:19:11.875 --> 00:19:14.375
...exactly the type you like.

00:19:15.708 --> 00:19:17.000
Do it.

00:19:17.000 --> 00:19:18.667
Meow!

00:19:20.750 --> 00:19:22.208
Stop it!

00:19:22.208 --> 00:19:24.250
Let me go!

00:19:24.250 --> 00:19:25.375
What's going on?

00:19:25.375 --> 00:19:26.833
You're really cute.

00:19:26.833 --> 00:19:28.333
What the heck...

00:19:28.333 --> 00:19:29.667
She's shaking.

00:19:29.667 --> 00:19:31.250
She's revealing her inexperience.

00:19:31.250 --> 00:19:32.292
...is going on?

00:19:32.292 --> 00:19:33.708
You look delicious.

00:19:33.708 --> 00:19:35.708
Maybe I'll kiss you.

00:19:36.917 --> 00:19:41.125
Th-They're so cute that they're
driving me out of my mind...!

00:19:42.958 --> 00:19:45.167
L-Let me go...

00:19:46.125 --> 00:19:48.250
If you want us to let you go...

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:54.333
...please read what's on this paper out loud!

00:19:54.333 --> 00:19:55.500
Wha...?!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:58.750
Wh-Why do I have to say things like that?!

00:19:58.750 --> 00:20:02.333
This is called Manifesto,
one of CVR's specialties!

00:20:02.333 --> 00:20:05.333
Declare that you'll choose your Amica

00:20:05.333 --> 00:20:08.833
over the dream world in front of you!

00:20:08.833 --> 00:20:09.708
Huh?!

00:20:09.708 --> 00:20:13.833
By saying that, your feelings
and resolution become firm!

00:20:13.833 --> 00:20:15.875
What's with you, fooling arou--

00:20:22.667 --> 00:20:25.000
Ki...

00:20:25.000 --> 00:20:27.083
Kirin's my bride!

00:20:29.625 --> 00:20:31.333
Congratulations!

00:20:31.333 --> 00:20:33.583
"Congrats! Kirin's my bride!"

00:20:33.875 --> 00:20:35.458
Heave-ho!

00:20:36.625 --> 00:20:38.708
What's... going on?

00:20:40.542 --> 00:20:43.583
So how'd it go with Kirin's request?

00:20:43.583 --> 00:20:44.583
Don't ask me about it.

00:20:44.583 --> 00:20:46.417
Did something happen?

00:20:48.750 --> 00:20:50.833
I'm not sure, but it seems

00:20:50.833 --> 00:20:54.083
that I wasn't the only one who
was worried about all sorts of things.

00:20:54.083 --> 00:20:55.375
Huh?

00:20:55.375 --> 00:21:00.542
Raika! Raika!

00:21:00.542 --> 00:21:02.042
Ah, Kirin!

00:21:02.042 --> 00:21:03.833
Good morning, Kirin!

00:21:03.833 --> 00:21:07.000
Good morning!

00:21:07.000 --> 00:21:12.000
Miss Mamiya, thank you very much
for all the help you gave me this time!

00:21:12.000 --> 00:21:16.667
Well, I don't know what you're
talking about, but you're welcome!

00:21:16.667 --> 00:21:20.708
So Raika! We're gonna
live together from now on!

00:21:20.708 --> 00:21:22.250
What? Live together?

00:21:23.583 --> 00:21:25.750
Why does it have to be like that?!

00:21:28.375 --> 00:21:30.375
Miss Mamiya! Miss Sasaki!

00:21:30.375 --> 00:21:34.292
Listen to this! Raika told me
yesterday that I'm her bride!

00:21:34.292 --> 00:21:35.708
Kirin's--

00:21:35.708 --> 00:21:37.792
Ahhhh!

00:21:40.250 --> 00:21:41.292
Bride?

00:21:41.292 --> 00:21:44.500
I didn't realize that their
friendship had developed that far!

00:21:44.500 --> 00:21:45.583
Grab!

00:21:45.583 --> 00:21:47.708
Let's do our best, too, okay?

00:21:47.708 --> 00:21:49.667
Huh? Huh?

00:21:50.792 --> 00:21:55.250
Well, it's true that you helped
us quite a bit this time.

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:57.375
I'll treat you later, Akari.

00:21:57.375 --> 00:21:59.958
Really?! All right!

00:21:59.958 --> 00:22:01.625
I'll come with you.

00:22:05.625 --> 00:22:07.250
She's wild, but...

00:22:07.250 --> 00:22:08.583
"Episode 6: Little Devils' Request"

00:22:08.583 --> 00:22:11.042
"Episode 6: Little Devils' Request"
...that's another wonderful side of her.

00:23:42.708 --> 00:23:46.542
Your act towards Akari
last night was outrageous.

00:23:46.542 --> 00:23:47.875
I find you guilty!

00:23:47.875 --> 00:23:53.375
You interrupted our friendship.
You're the one who's guilty!

00:23:53.375 --> 00:23:54.417
You're at the end of your rope.

00:23:54.417 --> 00:23:55.292
I won't lose!

00:23:55.292 --> 00:23:56.203
"Episode 7: Struggle over Akari"
